{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/ba9c6fdd80ac18422eb3f6877e1f87e0.poster.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/ba9c6fdd80ac18422eb3f6877e1f87e0.webm?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/ba9c6fdd80ac18422eb3f6877e1f87e0.mp4?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride or drive the turbulent waves of luck toward victory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel rogue-lite vertical scrolling Shmup that puts your resourcefulness to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and random arsenal of misdelivered heavy weapons enter into your possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the most effective way to utilize them and turn the tides of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/b351a8ac79ff880a881a9a642f92d3a5.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2050 AD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a far flung corner of the galaxy, an area known as the <strong>Sepulch Space Archipelago</strong> is attacked by an infamous band of raiders known as the <strong>\u201cRandomax Pirates\u201d!</strong> These nefarious marauders quickly subjugate the peaceful islands, transforming the region into a sea of evil villainy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid such turmoils, three women of exceedingly bold personalities appear on the scene determined to venture into these dangerous waters, along with a mysterious shipping company known as <strong>\u201cARGO EXPRESS\u201d</strong>! Erika, a self proclaimed employee of this company offers them a proposal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We'll give you our stock of misdelivered weapons and ammo. <i>Wanna use it to take out the bad guys?\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so a chaotic battle fueled by a vast stockpile of mismatched weapons quickly ensues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/3b60a9ebd03719dce87aa2830a38e35e.poster.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/3b60a9ebd03719dce87aa2830a38e35e.webm?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/3b60a9ebd03719dce87aa2830a38e35e.mp4?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters &amp; Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/48cb64f73227fb1295c6af9e4f1ba783.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmi</strong> The hot-blooded policewoman of the Planetary Police Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She proudly rides into battle piloting her ship the <strong>Blue Cosmic</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/574eaa29d2c97d4b4d5f2350e7704ae2.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urara</strong> The cyber idol and promising newcomer to the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 9 meters tall and weighing 550...(ahem!) She <i>IS</i> her ship, the <strong>URARARA\u2605Recital SP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/5aea1ad6b8e39babeebb5e06e15e3323.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dariha</strong> The dignified yet outcast aristocrat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She may wear rags, but her heart is brocade. A ceaseless savior for the common folk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her ship is the <strong>Barra 35T</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite vertical scrolling STG with over 70 types of randomly supplied equipment and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three equip slots to assign combinations of unique weapons such as \u201cback bombs\u201d and \u201cbullet reversing barriers\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you attack, defend, collect items, your play-style and your luck will generate an infinite number of possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/605ef71d756900c54974ab415fd703b2.poster.avif?t=1757829795\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/605ef71d756900c54974ab415fd703b2.webm?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096420/extras/605ef71d756900c54974ab415fd703b2.mp4?t=1757829795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages + 3 character-specific stages each for a total of 9 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 types of ships each with distinct characteristics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>More than 70 different types</strong> of equip-able armaments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique ending for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 adjustable difficulty levels</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/2fe7e6c0c7bcd71e8709cb8287d1daf31d17825c.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/e09e35812ec7f066537c1e2f24a27d23f3469875.jpg"},{"name":"[O.KUNARA] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/92aadcf60c80ceef1c8376d4b040051f765b688c.jpg"},{"name":"[O.REDOMOYO] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/8e170b784445f9c4918936c1aba1c18f4027d6ab.jpg"},{"name":"[F.NOYOK] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/41ba63b8859406791906ff95ec8b7dc3bfccaa91.jpg"},{"name":"[BREDON] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/8ba6b8796537221ca0a603f3e4e3b087012a51ae.jpg"},{"name":"[FKYDON] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/4b817498d2c7acaaf19d2e85e024e7a174d81426.jpg"},{"name":"[GAVEDON(A)] Destruction.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3096420/6e2d614333f6467f5826edbe535e1e21107f54b5.jpg"},{"name":"[TELEZDON-1] Destruction.","pat